%N A185056 Number of ways to place n nonattacking composite pieces bishop + semi-rook on an n X n board.
%C A185056 Two semi-rooks do not attack each other if they are in the same column.
%H A185056 Vaclav Kotesovec, <a href="https://oeis.org/wiki/User:Vaclav_Kotesovec">Non-attacking chess pieces</a>
%H A185056 Peter Allen Webb, <a href="https://github.com/peterallenwebb/A185056">Repository of A185056 calculation code</a> in Rust and CUDA, with computation logs.
%F A185056 a(n) = Sum_{subset of rows} (#ways to place a nonattacking piece on a black square in each selected row) * (#ways to place a nonattacking piece on a white square in each nonselected row). - _Martin Fuller_, Sep 13 2026
